  "goodToKnow": "Unterirdisch means underground or subterranean: unterirdische Gänge, unterirdische Stromleitungen. The new north-south power lines (SuedLink) are being built mostly underground after local protests. Colloquially, unterirdisch means abysmal: Das Spiel war unterirdisch (that match was dreadful), popular among football fans and critics. The opposite is oberirdisch (above ground)."
